title: drac2
---
<<set $charname to "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
You: *knock knock*
<<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: You may come in.
<<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    {$charname}: *yells* The door's open!
<<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    {$charname}: Come in but please don't turn off the lämp.
<<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    {$charname}: Oh you... just get in already!
<<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    {$charname}: If the smell of sweat doesn't bother you, then come in.
<<endif>>
You:
-> thx
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: Thanks for letting me in.
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        {$charname}: You're welcome.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        {$charname}: No problem.
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        {$charname}: Of kós.
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        {$charname}: You're always welcome. *winks*
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        {$charname}: ...9...10...11...12!
        {$charname}: No worries, darling, I just had to finish my reps.
    <<endif>>
-> huh
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum - 1>>
    <<endif>>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        You: Shouldn't it be the other way around?
        {$charname}: Probably.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        You: Why are you yelling?
        {$charname}: Because my room is really dark.
        {$charname}: Which means I can't hear you so well.
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        You: The lämp?
        {$charname}: Yes, the lämp.
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        You: Um, I am in.
        {$charname}: *amused smile* I can see that.
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        You: Why are you sweaty?
        {$charname}: These muscles have to be worked out or they get restless.
        You stare at her muscles.
        Somehow you get it.
    <<endif>>
-> boo
    You: Boo!
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        {$charname}: *blinks very slowly*
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        {$charname}: Ah, you almost got me.
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        {$charname}: *nods in agreement*
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        {$charname}: Now aren't you just adorable.
        You blush.
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        {$charname}: ...9...10...11...12!
        {$charname}: Sorry, did you say something?
    <<endif>>
You: I am here to get to know you better!
<<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
    {$charname}: Don't you say that to everyone?
    You: ...
    You: Yes, but I guess that's the point of the show?
    {$charname}: Touché.
<<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    {$charname}: Sure thing but please close the door.
    {$charname}: I am still hungover.
    Hungover? But how? Was there a party after the elimination ceremony you weren't invited to?
    The thought is gnawing on you like a very weak zombie.
<<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    {$charname}: Yes, a great idea. 
    {$charname}: We can start by looking at the lämp together.
    You stare at the lamp.
    It is kinda pretty.
<<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    {$charname}: Oooh, I can't wait for it.
    {$charname}: You can come an sit next to me if you want to.
    You want to.
    You don't know why but you really want to.
<<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    {$charname}: You are lucky, I just finished all my reps.
    {$charname}: ...
    {$charname}: Maybe I should go and have a shower first.
    You: Oh no, it's fine.
    It really is.
    Somehow she smells really nice.
<<endif>>
You: So...
-> ask about favourite dinosaur
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: My favourite dinosaur is the Pterodactylus. Which one is yours?
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        {$charname}: The Indominus Rex.
        You: That is not a real dinosaur.
        {$charname}: Is any dinosaur actually "real"?
        You: Yes?
        {$charname}: That's what they want you to believe.
        You: Who?
        {$charname}: The dinosaurs.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        {$charname}: Ooof.
        {$charname}: Probably the one with the long neck?
        You: The Brontosaurus?
        You: The Brachiosaurus?
        You: The Diplodocus?
        You: The Apatosaurus?
        You: The Argentinosaurus?
        {$charname}: Ah, my bad.
        {$charname}: I meant the Compsognathus.
        You: That's a fucking chicken.
        {$charname}: A dinosaur chicken.
        You: Aren't all chicken dinosaurs?
        {$charname}: Maybe but not all dinosaurs are chicken.
        You: Can't argue with that.
        {$charname}: *cheep*
        You: *cheep*
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        {$charname}: I guess that would be Archaeolepis mane.
        You: But that's a moth?
        {$charname}: Correct.
        You: And not a dinosaur?
        {$charname}: Correct.
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    <<endif>>
-> talk about the last time you slipped on a banana peel
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum - 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: It really hurt.
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        You: I broke my elbow.
        {$charname}: I don't care that you broke your elbow.
        You: Really?
        {$charname}: No of course not, do you have any x-rays?
        You show her the x-rays.
        She snatches them out of your hands and spends about 10 minutes looking at them while occasionally muttering "...bones...".
        It is kind of endearing.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    <<endif>>
-> insinuate that the moon is not real
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: The moon is fake.
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        {$charname}: You mean the moonlanding?
        You: No... the moon.
        {$charname}: A fascinating hypothesis.
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    <<endif>>
-> start singing a song
    <<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
        <<set $drac = $drac + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
        <<set $witch = $witch - 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
        <<set $moth = $moth + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
        <<set $fish = $fish + 1>>
    <<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
        <<set $mum = $mum + 1>>
    <<endif>>
    You: It's astounding...
    You: Time is fleeting...
    You: Madness... takes it's toll..
    You: But listen closely!
    {$charname}: Not for very much longer.
    You: I've got to... keep control.
    You: I remember doing the Time Warp!
    You: Drinking those moments when...
    You: The blackness would hit me!
    Together: And the void would be calling
    Together: Let's do the time warp again...
    Together: Let's do the time warp again!
    You do the Time Warp.
    Again.
    It works out surprisingly well.
You: I feel like I already know you better!
You: But now I would really like to know what you think about:
-> Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula <<if $charname != "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Acula">>
